{"version":1,"content":"<p>世界氣象組織10月27日發佈最新《温室氣體公報》指出，由於化石燃料持續燃燒，2025年全球大氣中的二氧化碳及其他主要温室氣體濃度均升至歷史最高水平，全球變暖趨勢正在進一步被鎖定，其影響可能持續數十年甚至數百年。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584144.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:21:47.483799+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:08:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:19.302048+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:19.302048+00:00","content_hash":"1b38a152425e5a20d672824bc92b8ef55bfe8c1c383122e10e57d1f285e5be97","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}